### Register (run once; a second run returns 409)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "123456789", "firstName": "John", "lastName": "Doe" }

### Login (saves the token)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "123456789" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Get my profile
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change my profile
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lastName": "Depp"}